    <briefdescription>
<para>The actual data that&apos;s stored, as a doubly-linked list implemented via indices into the DenseVector. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The doubly linked list is implemented circular in Prev indices, and INVALID-terminated in Next indices. This provides efficient access to list tails. These nodes can also be tombstones, in which case they are actually nodes in a single-linked freelist of recyclable slots. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
